已将报告建议的补充测试代码中的中文注释、测试集名称替换为英文，并保持原有的尺寸与类型断言逻辑。下面是一个可直接追加到 `test_imresize.jl` 末尾的顶层 `@testset`。

```julia
@testset "imresize additional coverage" begin
    @testset "Float64 size vector" begin
        img = rand(UInt8, 20, 30)
        # Use a Float64 vector to specify output size
        _sz = [12.0, 20.0]
        new_img = imresize(img, _sz)
        @test size(new_img) == (12, 20)
        @test eltype(new_img) == UInt8
    end

    @testset "Upscaling scenario" begin
        img = rand(Float64, 20, 30)
        # Test upscaling (scale > 1)
        new_img = imresize(img, 2.0)
        @test size(new_img) == (40, 60)
        @test eltype(new_img) == Float64
    end
end
```

仅保留文档声明的 `Float64` 向量尺寸参数覆盖缺口，移除放大场景测试。依据报告，`[numrows, numcols]` 需补充 `Float64` 类型的直接测试，且源码已提供 `Vector{Float64}` 方法。以下为可追加到 `test_imresize.jl` 末尾的独立测试块：

```julia
@testset "imresize additional coverage" begin
    @testset "Float64 size vector" begin
        img = rand(UInt8, 20, 30)
        # Use a Float64 vector to specify output size
        _sz = [12.0, 20.0]
        new_img = imresize(img, _sz)
        @test size(new_img) == (12, 20)
        @test eltype(new_img) == UInt8
    end
end
```
